#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/maintenance/index.rst:5
msgid ""
"Using Sphinx, themes and extensions means that your documentation project "
"needs to fetch a set of dependencies, each with a special version. Over "
"time, using an unspecified version means that documentation projects "
"suddenly start breaking. In this guide, you learn how to secure your project"
" against sudden breakage. **This is one of our most popular guides!**"
msgstr ""
"使用 "
"Sphinx、主题和扩展意味着你的文档项目需要获取一组依赖，每个都有特定版本。日积月累，使用不固定的版本会导致文档项目突然失效。本指南讲解如何让项目免于意外失效。**这是我们最受欢迎的指南之一！**"

